<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Central Bank offers 58-day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Philippine Central Bank offers 58-day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Monday it started offering 58-day special series Treasury bills with a yield rate of 10.20 percent.</p>
<p>It stopped selling the 89-day T-bill which carried a rate of 10.5 percent.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
